{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013QU9C1Y1sPfgLLrADyjthi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# TypeORM persistence checks\n2\t\n3\t- Keep domain objects independent of TypeORM decorators.\n4\t- Map explicitly between ORM and domain representations.\n5\t- Implement every repository method used by application code.\n6\t- Put uniqueness and referential integrity in database constraints, not only preflight queries.\n7\t- Translate expected constraint violations to stable domain/application errors.\n8\t- Analyze concurrent writes and transaction isolation.\n9\t- Add forward and reversible migrations; register entities and migrations with the real datasource.\n10\t- Test adapters against PostgreSQL when behavior depends on SQL, constraints or transactions.\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5d102af9-172e-451d-979a-7278a337c3c4","uuid":"6a4c9aa5-d5ee-407e-be03-740c6d106161","timestamp":"2026-08-07T15:18:11.671Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/cmc/Documents/Memories/ai/skills/implement-nestjs-vertical-slice/references/persistence.md","content":"# TypeORM persistence checks\n\n- Keep domain objects independent of TypeORM decorators.\n- Map explicitly between ORM and domain representations.\n- Implement every repository method used by application code.\n- Put uniqueness and referential integrity in database constraints, not only preflight queries.\n- Translate expected constraint violations to stable domain/application errors.\n- Analyze concurrent writes and transaction isolation.\n- Add forward and reversible migrations; register entities and migrations with the real datasource.\n- Test adapters against PostgreSQL when behavior depends on SQL, constraints or transactions.\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}}}
