{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Avi3JfYErb8UPxBMrkhDTY","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Dependency-injection checks\n2\t\n3\tFor every `@Inject(TOKEN)` or constructor dependency:\n4\t\n5\t1. Locate the token declaration and interface.\n6\t2. Locate the concrete adapter or service.\n7\t3. Locate a provider using `provide`, `useClass`, `useFactory`, `useExisting` or a directly injectable class.\n8\t4. Verify its module imports dependencies required by the provider.\n9\t5. Verify the consuming use case/controller is registered.\n10\t6. Verify exports when another module consumes the token.\n11\t7. Compile a testing module or boot the relevant application in an integration/E2E test.\n12\t\n13\tA TypeScript compile does not prove the Nest runtime graph is resolvable.\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5d102af9-172e-451d-979a-7278a337c3c4","uuid":"ce9953fe-5742-496d-bc66-cd4e36fc6ce8","timestamp":"2026-08-07T15:18:12.199Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/cmc/Documents/Memories/ai/skills/implement-nestjs-vertical-slice/references/dependency-injection.md","content":"# Dependency-injection checks\n\nFor every `@Inject(TOKEN)` or constructor dependency:\n\n1. Locate the token declaration and interface.\n2. Locate the concrete adapter or service.\n3. Locate a provider using `provide`, `useClass`, `useFactory`, `useExisting` or a directly injectable class.\n4. Verify its module imports dependencies required by the provider.\n5. Verify the consuming use case/controller is registered.\n6. Verify exports when another module consumes the token.\n7. Compile a testing module or boot the relevant application in an integration/E2E test.\n\nA TypeScript compile does not prove the Nest runtime graph is resolvable.\n","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}}}
