iterion\": \"3. UserProfile được đặt trong module `user-profiles`, không nằm trong module `customers`.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"libs/modules/user-profiles/src/domain/user-profile.ts; no `customers` module exists in this epic.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"4. Customer không được tạo tự động khi tạo Account.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"CreateAccountUseCase creates only Account, AuthIdentity, UserProfile and AccountRole; no Customer model/table exists.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"5. Account, AuthIdentity và UserProfile được triển khai đầy đủ theo các layer hiện tại.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"domain/application/infrastructure/presentation present for all three (account.ts, auth-identity.ts, user-profile.ts + repositories, mappers, orm-entities, use-cases, controllers).\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"6. Một Account có thể có nhiều AuthIdentity.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"AuthIdentityOrmEntity has no unique constraint on accountId alone, only (provider, identifier) and (provider, providerSubject); DeleteAccountUseCase iterates findAllByAccountId (plural).\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"7. Một Account chỉ có tối đa một UserProfile.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"Partial unique index UQ_profile_user_profiles_account_id ON (account_id) WHERE deleted_at IS NULL, verified by running the CreateUserProfilesSchema migration; auth-flow.e2e-spec.ts asserts a second profile for the same account returns 409.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"8. LOCAL AuthIdentity sử dụng phone đã normalize và password hash.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"PhoneNormalizer + ScryptPasswordHasher used in CreateAccountUseCase; phone-normalizer.spec.ts and scrypt-password-hasher.spec.ts pass.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"9. Login bằng email không còn hoạt động.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"LoginDto (login.dto.ts) has only phone/password/portal fields, no email; grep for mock/email-login logic in identity-access/user-profiles found nothing.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"10. Public web đăng nhập với portal `PUBLIC`.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"Reinterpreted backend-only per requirement-addendum.md cycle 1 (no frontend in scope): auth-flow.e2e-spec.ts 'logs in a default account on the PUBLIC portal' passes against POST /auth/login {portal: 'PUBLIC'}.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"11. Admin web đăng nhập với portal `ADMIN`.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"Reinterpreted backend-only per requirement-addendum.md cycle 1: auth-flow.e2e-spec.ts 'logs in an account granted the ADMIN role on the ADMIN portal' passes against POST /auth/login {portal: 'ADMIN'}.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"12. Backend tự map portal sang permission tương ứng.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"PORTAL_PERMISSION map in domain/sessions/portal.ts, applied in login.use-case.ts and refresh-session.use-case.ts; client never supplies a permission code (LoginDto has no such field).\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"13. Account phải có `portal.public.access` để đăng nhập public.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"LoginUseCase checks hasPermissions(accountId, [PORTAL_PERMISSION.PUBLIC]) unconditionally; PUBLIC_USER default role seeded with portal.public.access.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"14. Account phải có `portal.admin.access` để đăng nhập admin.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"Same check for PORTAL_PERMISSION.ADMIN; e2e test confirms a PUBLIC-only account gets 403 attempting ADMIN login.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"15. Account thiếu permission portal không được phát token hoặc tạo refresh session cho portal đó.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"LoginUseCase throws ForbiddenException before entering unitOfWork.withTransaction (no session/token created) when hasPortalAccess is false.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"16. Không controller hoặc use case nào hard-code role để kiểm tra quyền truy cập portal.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"LoginUseCase and PortalGuard operate on PermissionChecker/portal claim only; no role-name string comparison found in either.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"17. Role chỉ là nhóm permission.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"Role domain model (role.ts) carries only code/name; behavior comes entirely from RolePermission grants, no role-specific logic branches.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"18. Account inactive, locked hoặc deleted không thể login hoặc refresh.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"Account.canAuthenticate() checked in both LoginUseCase and RefreshSessionUseCase; e2e tests cover INACTIVE/LOCKED/deleted login and locked-account refresh.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"19. Access token tiếp tục được lưu trong memory.\", \"status\": \"not_tested\", \"evidence\": \"Frontend storage concern; no frontend in scope since requirement-addendum.md cycle 1. Backend does not persist or dictate client-side token storage.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"20. Refresh token tiếp tục được lưu trong HttpOnly cookie.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"buildRefreshCookieOptions (refresh-cookie.helper.ts) sets httpOnly:true; e2e asserts set-cookie header matches /HttpOnly/i.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"21. Refresh session được gắn với portal.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"RefreshSession domain props include portal; refresh-session.orm-entity.ts persists it; RefreshSessionUseCase preserves the original session's portal on rotation.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"22. JWT hoặc session có thể phân biệt public và admin portal.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"Access/refresh token payloads include a portal claim (issueAccessToken/issueRefreshToken calls in login/refresh use cases).\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"23. Token public không thể truy cập admin API nếu không hợp lệ về audience hoặc portal.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"PortalGuard + @RequirePortal('ADMIN') on AccountController and UserProfileController; e2e 'rejects a PUBLIC-portal token even when the underlying account also holds admin permissions' passes for both controllers (fix-request item 2).\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"24. Password không được lưu dưới dạng plain text.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"ScryptPasswordHasher.hash used for all password storage; AuthIdentity only stores passwordHash.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"25. Password hash không xuất hiện trong API response, log hoặc audit record.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"AccountResponseDto/toAccountResponseDto never include passwordHash; e2e asserts JSON.stringify(listRes.body) does not match /passwordHash/i.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"26. Account, AuthIdentity và UserProfile có đầy đủ audit fields.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"All three extend AuditableProps/AuditableOrmEntity (created_by/at, updated_by/at, deleted_by/at) verified in the applied migrations.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"27. Audit actor được lấy từ request context.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"Fix-request item 6: all identity-access use cases (create/change-status/change-password/delete-account) now call RequestContext.currentActorId() instead of accepting a client actorId field.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"28. Hai request đồng thời không bị lẫn context.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"RequestContext is AsyncLocalStorage-backed (request-context.ts); e2e 'resolves each of several concurrent logins to its own account, never crossing subjects' passes with 5 concurrent logins.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"29. Tạo Account, AuthIdentity, UserProfile và default role được thực hiện trong cùng transaction.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"CreateAccountUseCase wraps all steps in one unitOfWork.withTransaction; verified UserProfileProvisioner participates in the same DB transaction because both modules' repositories resolve the active connection via the shared AsyncLocalStorage-backed TypeOrmQueryRunnerContext.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"30. Account CRUD API hoạt động và được bảo vệ bằng permission.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"create/list/get/change-status/change-phone/change-password/delete all implemented and permission-guarded (see decisions re: no generic PATCH); fix-request item 8 resolved by removing the non-functional generic update rather than leaving a fake 200.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"31. UserProfile CRUD API hoạt động và được bảo vệ bằng permission.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"create/list/get/update/delete implemented in UserProfileController, all @RequirePermissions-gated and PortalGuard('ADMIN')-gated (fix-request item 2).\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"32. Xóa hoặc khóa Account làm mất hiệu lực session hiện tại.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"ChangeAccountStatusUseCase/DeleteAccountUseCase revoke all refresh sessions; JwtAuthGuard additionally checks live Account status/tokenVersion on every request so an already-issued access token stops working immediately (fix-request item 1), not just at natural expiry -- covered by e2e 'rejects an already-issued access token immediately once the Account is locked'.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"33. Không sử dụng TypeORM relation trực tiếp xuyên module.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"npm run test:architecture passes with 0 violations across 382 modules; UserProfile/Account cross-module lookups go through AccountLookup/UserProfileLookup ports, not TypeORM relations.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"34. Không trả ORM entity trực tiếp từ controller.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"Every controller maps through a response DTO (toAccountResponseDto, toResponseDto for UserProfile) built from a use-case output type, never the ORM entity.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"35. Swagger/OpenAPI được cập nhật.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"npm run export:openapi succeeds; generated openapi.json documents all /auth, /accounts, /user-profiles routes with @ApiTags/@ApiResponse/@ApiBearerAuth decorators present on both controllers.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"36 (thay thế theo requirement-addendum.md cycle 1). Swagger/OpenAPI backend phản ánh đúng các endpoint auth/account/user-profile hiện có.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"Same openapi.json evidence as AC35; no frontend API client exists or is required in this backend-only epic.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"37. Migration chạy thành công trên database trống.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"npm run migration:run against a freshly created, empty PostgreSQL database (memories_migration_check) applied all 5 migrations successfully; database dropped after verification.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"38. Seed Role và Permission chạy nhiều lần không tạo dữ liệu trùng.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"SeedRolesAndPermissionsUseCase uses find-or-create for permissions/roles; seed-roles-and-permissions.use-case.spec.ts passes, and auth-flow.e2e-spec.ts calls seed.execute() at suite start without unique-constraint failures against a database already containing prior runs' seeded rows.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"39 (thay thế theo requirement-addendum.md cycle 1). Mock authentication được xóa khỏi backend.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"grep for mock-related auth code in identity-access/user-profiles/api returned nothing; login exclusively resolves through LocalAuthenticationProvider against real AuthIdentity/Account records.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"40. Unit test, integration test, E2E test, lint, typecheck và build đều thành công.\", \"status\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"npm run lint, typecheck, test (232 tests/51 suites), build, test:architecture, migration:run+revert and test:e2e (35 tests/4 suites) all pass in this cycle -- see validation_commands.\" }\n  ],\n  \"knowledge_updates\": [\n    {\n      \"target\": \"ai/repos/backend/architecture.md\",\n      \"type\": \"suggestion\",\n      \"summary\": \"Consider documenting the AccountController contract decision explicitly (no generic PATCH /accounts/:accountId; status/phone/password each have a dedicated endpoint because Account carries no other mutable field) so future reviewers don't re-flag the missing route as a defect.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"target\": \"ai/repos/backend/testing.md\",\n      \"type\": \"suggestion\",\n      \"summary\": \"Note that any E2E test hitting POST /auth/refresh must set an Origin header matching a CORS_ORIGIN allowlist entry (OriginGuard), since supertest sends no Origin by default and the app enforces this whenever CORS_ORIGIN is configured.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"applied_skills\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"decompose-implementation-task\",\n      \"sha256\": \"0d8e89a94111bd5679c8c5ef6c8f5ce250621909f51704bf676af966f2fd4673\",\n      \"checks_completed\": [\n        \"Confirmed execution-plan.json maps every task.md section to exactly one slice, ordered and independently verifiable\",\n        \"Ran scripts/validate_execution_plan.py ai/tasks/MEMORIES-0002/execution-plan.json -> pass (20 slices)\",\n        \"Kept implementation-progress.json.current_slice aligned with plan state (null at handoff; all slices verified complete)\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"implement-nestjs-vertical-slice\",\n      \"sha256\": \"46320b8e5f671d095152f339031d0470207a8caa7de73e0e219b45b683321335\",\n      \"checks_completed\": [\n        \"Verified layer matrix completeness (domain/application/infrastructure/wiring/persistence/presentation/verification) for Account, AuthIdentity, UserProfile, RefreshSession, Role, Permission by direct file inspection\",\n        \"Traced ACCOUNT_LOOKUP/PERMISSION_CHECKER/USER_PROFILE_PROVISIONER/USER_PROFILE_LOOKUP ports from consumer to concrete Nest provider to @Global() exporting module\",\n        \"Ran scripts/check_port_bindings.py worktrees/MEMORIES-0002/backend -> pass (28 injected Symbol tokens)\",\n        \"Ran scripts/check_module_wiring.py worktrees/MEMORIES-0002/backend -> pass (27 use-case/controller classes)\",\n        \"Ran npm run build and npm run test:architecture (both pass) confirming runtime Nest graph resolvability and module boundaries beyond a bare tsc compile\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"implement-auth-security-change\",\n      \"sha256\": \"8de0236f5e04b9c74a738f6ffc71224070c4ddd230cbccbe88fe8e1144627332\",\n      \"checks_completed\": [\n        \"Verified session/authorization invariants: locked/inactive/deleted accounts rejected on login and refresh; access tokens invalidated live via tokenVersion+isActive check, not only at expiry\",\n        \"Verified identity/credential rules: normalized phone as canonical identifier, scrypt password hashing, no passwordHash in responses/logs\",\n        \"Verified security-verification coverage via auth-flow.e2e-spec.ts: valid/invalid login, no-enumeration wrong-password vs unknown-phone, locked/inactive/deleted accounts, portal privilege escalation attempts, concurrent refresh race, transaction rollback on provisioning failure (create-account.use-case.spec.ts)\",\n        \"Ran scripts/check_auth_invariants.py worktrees/MEMORIES-0002/backend -> pass\",\n        \"Added and verified a new negative/CSRF test (missing/disallowed Origin on /auth/refresh) after finding the existing suite lacked one\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2449,"cache_read_input_tokens":221516,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2449},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5d102af9-172e-451d-979a-7278a337c3c4","uuid":"cc2966ee-8167-4957-9289-42cba9f6bc87","timestamp":"2026-08-07T15:48:06.928Z","request_id":"req_011CdoeZ9M6jpY4Wy3LUcacD"}
